{"sha": "37c0c57b09bff1585e0e612a4cedeb17390d7254ba653d16b9716c7aa45bf485", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:work-and-energy} 章 --- 功与机械能}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:1}", "$E_p = \\tfrac12 \\times 200 \\times 0.050^2 = \\qty{0.25}{J}$。拉伸量加倍，", "能量为 $\\times 4$，即 \\qty{1.0}{J}。第二段 \\qty{5.0}{cm}", "单独需做功 $1.0 - 0.25 = \\qty{0.75}{J}$ --- 该段的力更大。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:2}", "$W = mg(z_A - z_B) = 0.90 \\times 9.81 \\times (12 - 30) \\approx", "\\qty{-1.6e2}{J}$，与路径无关，沿直线爬升亦然。", "往返一周的功为 \\qty{0}{J}（保守力）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:3}", "(a)、(b) 为保守力：功仅由端点决定（高度下降；", "伸长量）。(c)、(e) 为非保守力：功为 $-fL$，阻力每行进一米", "所做的功。(d) 不做功：力始终与运动方向垂直。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:4}", "$h = L(1 - \\cos\\qty{60}{\\degree}) = \\qty{1.0}{m}$;", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times 1.0} \\approx \\qty{4.4}{m/s}$。", "绳的张力在每一时刻都与运动方向垂直：功率为零，", "做功亦为零。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:5}", "$F = P/v = 250/9.0 \\approx \\qty{28}{N}$。速率为 \\qty{5.0}{m/s} 时：", "$F = 250/5.0 = \\qty{50}{N}$（主要为斜坡重力的分量）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:6}", "$E_p = \\tfrac12 \\times 450 \\times 0.080^2 = \\qty{1.44}{J}$;", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 1.44/0.020} = \\qty{12}{m/s}$;", "$h = E_p/mg = 1.44/(0.020 \\times 9.81) \\approx \\qty{7.3}{m}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:7}", "梯形法（步长 \\qty{2.0}{cm}）：$(0.03 + 0.10 + 0.19 + 0.30) =", "\\qty{0.62}{J}$。直线模型：$k = 18.0/0.080 =", "\\qty{225}{N/m}$，$\\tfrac12 kx^2 = \\qty{0.72}{J}$。实测曲线", "在较小的 $x$ 处低于直线，因此真实面积", "更小。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:8}", "$\\Delta E_m = \\tfrac12 \\times 55 \\times 9.0^2 - 55 \\times 9.81 \\times", "8.0 = 2228 - 4316 \\approx \\qty{-2.1e3}{J}$;", "$f = 2089/25 \\approx \\qty{84}{N}$。重力为保守力，法向力", "不做功：只取决于下降高度和路径 \\emph{长度}，与", "路径形状无关。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:9}", "$H_{\\min} = \\tfrac52 R = \\qty{0.50}{m}$。从 \\qty{60}{cm} 高处释放：", "$v_{\\text{最高点}} = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times (0.60 - 0.40)} \\approx", "\\qty{2.0}{m/s}$，且 $v_{\\text{最高点}}^2/(gR) = 2.0$ --- 为", "最小值的两倍。摩擦会持续消耗能量，因此实际轨道需要更大的", "高度。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:10}", "转折点：$8.0\\,x^2 = 2.0$，$x = \\pm\\qty{0.50}{m}$。最大", "速率在 $x = 0$ 处：$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 2.0/0.100} \\approx", "\\qty{6.3}{m/s}$。这是抛物线形势阱中的往复振动 ---", "弹簧振子的 $E_p$ 恰好属于这种形式。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:11}", "$\\tfrac12 kx^2 = \\tfrac12 mv^2$:", "$x = v\\sqrt{m/k} = 2.0\\sqrt{1200/\\num{6.0e5}} \\approx \\qty{8.9}{cm}$.", "速率为 \\qty{4.0}{m/s} 时：\\qty{18}{cm} --- 只是两倍而非四倍：能量", "变为四倍，但 $E_p$ 随 $x^2$ 增长，因此 $x$ 只增为两倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:12}", "(a) $E_m = \\qty{5.0}{J} < \\qty{6.0}{J}$：它无法越过，将在", "$E_p = \\qty{5.0}{J}$ 处的斜坡停下并滚回。(b) 山顶：", "$E_k = \\qty{1.0}{J}$, $v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 1.0/0.50} = \\qty{2.0}{m/s}$;", "谷底：$E_k = \\qty{5.0}{J}$，$v \\approx \\qty{4.5}{m/s}$。(c) $x = 0$ 处：", "不稳定（极大值）；$x = \\qty{1.5}{m}$ 处：稳定（极小值）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:13}", "$\\tfrac12 mv^2 = mgR_E$:", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times \\num{6.37e6}} \\approx \\qty{1.12e4}{m/s}", "= \\qty{11.2}{km/s}$。各项都正比于 $m$：探测器与", "小石子皆然。略小于此速度发射时，物体仍会上升极远，", "到达转折点后落回，属于束缚运动。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:14}", "$E_m = \\tfrac12 kA^2 = \\tfrac12 \\times 40 \\times 0.060^2 =", "\\qty{7.2e-2}{J}$; $v_{\\max} = \\sqrt{2E_m/m} =", "\\sqrt{2 \\times 0.072/0.250} \\approx \\qty{0.76}{m/s}$;", "$E_k = E_p$ 的位置满足 $\\tfrac12 kx^2 = E_m/2$：$x = \\pm A/\\sqrt 2 \\approx", "\\pm\\qty{4.2}{cm}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:work-and-energy:15}", "$h = v^2/2g = 9.5^2/19.62 \\approx \\qty{4.6}{m}$；横杆高度 $\\approx", "4.6 + 1.0 = \\qty{5.6}{m}$。纪录更高：运动员借助", "手臂与腿在弯曲的撑竿上额外做功。但能量估算确定了", "数量级 --- 任何短跑选手的撑竿跳都达不到 \\qty{10}{m}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:work-and-energy:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $v = \\sqrt{2gH} = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times 45} \\approx", "\\qty{29.7}{m/s}$：重力为保守力，法向力不做功 --- 与", "轨道形状无关。", ""]}